Meta tag editing
description: the meta_tag_editing state
- >
  The `!!<` and `>` are projected with the tag-content cell between them, cursor inside
- !!<*yamlover: $defs: table>
  header:
    - Event
      width: 2
    - 'Condition / note'
      width: 4
    - 'Next state'
      width: 2
  - ['`alphanumeric`', '', '`meta_tag_editing` (stays)']
  - ['`gt`', '', '[value_hole](::server:yamlover-editor:value_hole)']
  - ['`enter`', '', '[value_hole](::server:yamlover-editor:value_hole)']
  - ['`backspace`', 'the content became empty', '[empty_cell_of_origin](::server:yamlover-editor:empty_cell_of_origin)']
  - ['`backspace`', 'otherwise', '`meta_tag_editing` (stays)']
